    "minimum_delta_rationale": "The comparator is the projection the surfaces executed before this release, not the unbounded observation. Deterministic retention is 25 of 26 for the candidate against 2 of 26 for the control, so the structural margin is 88.46 points. The floor absorbs the two confounds the protocol records: model error, which costs the candidate, and prior-answerability, which costs the control and therefore deflates the delta. It is the single accuracy gate, and the runner rejects any protocol in which the guards already imply it. A floor at parity, or at the closed v5 minus 2 points, would pass on a projection that changed nothing.",
